    <sys:String x:Key="S.Overlay.Stuck">Windows is set to Best performance, and it is holding your processor at full speed even when the laptop is doing nothing. That is why changing modes seems to have no effect.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="S.Overlay.GuardMissing">Nothing is stopping another application from switching to that mode and holding the processor at full speed again.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="S.Overlay.NothingToDo">Nothing needed changing.</sys:String>
